s. Then, you will complete a short follow-up questionnaire. This study will take you approximately ${e:\/\/Field\/time} minutes to complete.&nbsp;<\/p><p><br><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Payment<\/strong>: For completing this study, you are guaranteed to receive $${e:\/\/Field\/showup} within 24 hours. In addition, one part from Parts 1-${e:\/\/Field\/nparts} will be chosen as the part-that-counts. You will receive how much you earn in the part-that-counts as your bonus payment.<\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0fh8gyEGCFDq42a","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID527","SecondaryAttribute":"Comprehension check: Which of the following is true?\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"For completing this study, I will receive $${e:\/\/Field\/showup} for sure, and I do NOT have a chance of receiving a higher amount."},"2":{"Display":"For completing this study, I will receive at least $${e:\/\/Field\/showup}. I will also receive the amount I earn in the part-that-counts, which may result in me receiving an additional payment as a bonus payment."},"3":{"Display":"For completing this study, I will receive at least $${e:\/\/Field\/showup}. The total amount I earn depends on my answers in all parts of this study."}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q51","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Comprehension check: Which of the following is true?\u00a0","QuestionID":"QID527","QuestionText":"<b>Comprehension check: <\/b>Which of the following is true?&nbsp;","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b>Comprehension check: <\/b>Which of the following is true?&nbsp;","QuestionType":"MC","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"None"},"Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID10\/SelectableChoice\/2","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Comprehension check: Which of the following is true?&nbsp;<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">For completing this study, I will receive at least $${e:\/\/Field\/showup}. I will also receive the amount I earn in the question-that-counts, which may result in me receiving an additional payment as a bonus payment.<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID10\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID10","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID10","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"incorrect answer","libraryID":"UR_cAtjJf4eqOWGcDA","messageID":"MS_42EWahFVsD2E0jY","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}},"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0fh8gyEGCFDq42a","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID528","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q92","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":28,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID528","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0fh8gyEGCFDq42a","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID529","SecondaryAttribute":"The Math Tests\u00a0 In Parts 1 - 3, you will take a math test. Each math test will involve ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q89","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"The Math Tests\u00a0 In Parts 1 - 3, you will take a math test. Each math test will involve ...","QuestionID":"QID529","QuestionText":"<h3>The Math Tests&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<p>In Parts 1 - 3, you will take a math test. Each math test will involve ${e:\/\/Field\/nquestions} questions. You will be given ${e:\/\/Field\/seconds_to_answer} seconds to answer each question.<\/p>\n\n<p>In each question, you are shown nine pairs of numbers and asked to select which pair of numbers, if any, adds up to 100.<\/p>\n\n<p>After answering each question, you are awarded zero points or one point.<\/p>\n\n<p>For each question with a pair of numbers that sums of to 100:<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 point&nbsp;is awarded if you select&nbsp;the pair that sums up to 100,&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>0 points are awarded otherwise.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>For each question that does NOT have a pair of numbers that sums of to 100,&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 point is awarded if you do NOT select&nbsp;any&nbsp;pair of numbers, and&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>0 points are awarded otherwise.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>That is, your answer to each question is awarded 1 point if:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>you select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100, or&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/li>\n\t<li>you select nothing when there is no pair that sums up to 100.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>Your score on a math test equals the sum of points you earn across all questions.&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong>The lowest possible score is 0 points, and the highest possible score is 15 points.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>A higher score in the math test represents better performance in the math test.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<h3>The Math Tests&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<p>In Parts 1 - 3, you will take a math test. Each math test will involve ${e:\/\/Field\/nquestions} questions. You will be given ${e:\/\/Field\/seconds_to_answer} seconds to answer each question.<\/p>\n\n<p>In each question, you are shown nine pairs of numbers and asked to select which pair of numbers, if any, adds up to 100.<\/p>\n\n<p>After answering each question, you are awarded zero points or one point.<\/p>\n\n<p>For each question with a pair of numbers that sums of to 100:<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 point&nbsp;is awarded if you select&nbsp;the pair that sums up to 100,&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>0 points are awarded otherwise.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>For each question that does NOT have a pair of numbers that sums of to 100,&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 point is awarded if you do NOT select&nbsp;any&nbsp;pair of numbers, and&nbsp;<\/li>\n\t<li>0 points are awarded otherwise.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>That is, your answer to each question is awarded 1 point if:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>you select a pair of numbers that sums up to 100, or&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/li>\n\t<li>you select nothing when there is no pair that sums up to 100.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p>Your score on a math test equals the sum of points you earn across all questions.&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;<\/strong>The lowest possible score is 0 points, and the highest possible score is 15 points.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>A higher score in the math test represents better performance in the math test.&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0fh8gyEGCFDq42a","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID530","SecondaryAttribute":"Comprehension check: If you are shown the following pairs of numbers in a question, you will be a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["2","4","5"],"Choices":{"2":{"Display":"you select nothing"},"4":{"Display":"you select (12,85)"},"5":{"Display":"you select (73,27)"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q90","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":6,"QuestionDescription":"Comprehension check: If you are shown the following pairs of numbers in a question, you will be a...","QuestionID":"QID530","QuestionText":"<p><b>Comprehension check:<\/b> If you are shown the following pairs of numbers in a question, you will be awarded 1 point (rather than 0 points) if...<\/p>\n\n<p>(12,85), (33,44), (73,27), (19,68), (91,3), (54,12), (88,9), (41,23), (66,15)<\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><b>Comprehension check:<\/b> If you are shown the following pairs of numbers in a question, you will be awarded 1 point (rather than 0 points) if...<\/p>\n\n<p>(12,85), (33,44), (73,27), (19,68), (91,3), (54,12), (88,9), (41,23), (66,15)<\/p>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID90\/SelectableChoice\/5","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Comprehension check: If you are shown the following pairs of numbers, what is the correct answer?...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">To click on (73,27)<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID90\/SelectableChoice\/5","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID90","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID90","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"incorrect answer","libraryID":"UR_cAtjJf4eqOWGcDA","messageID":"MS_42EWahFVsD2E0jY","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}},"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0fh8gyEGCFDq42a","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID531","SecondaryAttribute":"Comprehension check: If you are shown the following pairs of numbers in a question, you will be a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"you select nothing"},"2":{"Display":"you select (14,83)"},"3":{"Display":"you select (22,71)"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDes